{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121712","id":4123440021,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc71xrOV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121712","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121712.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121712.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121712","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121712/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121712/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121712/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/704ed7d762fa041a8a3e970632540b205a41d68e","number":121712,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"NVIDIA Wayland Editor Unresponsive Fix & Mailbox opt-in","user":{"login":"bearlikelion","id":3298808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTg4MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3298808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion","html_url":"https://github.com/bearlikelion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bearlikelion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Helps: [godotengine/godot#114986](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114986)\r\n\r\nThe editor can permanently freeze on Linux/Wayland causing lost work, especially with NVIDIA's proprietary driver when additional windows are involved (tooltips, popup menus, floating docks, the embedded game view, etc.). As described in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114986#issuecomment-4503913566, there are two places where the main loop can wait indefinitely:\r\n\r\n1. `swap_chain_acquire_framebuffer()` calls `vkAcquireNextImageKHR` with `UINT64_MAX`. Under NVIDIA + Wayland, nested `wl_subsurface` windows (such as the embedded game view) can cause this call to block forever.\r\n2. `DisplayServerWayland::try_suspend()` waits for frame callbacks for up to 1000 ms at a time. If the compositor stops delivering callbacks, input isn't processed and the editor appears frozen.\r\n\r\nThis PR bounds both waits and adds an optional workaround:\r\n\r\n- `rendering/rendering_device/vulkan/swapchain_acquire_timeout_ms` (default: `1000`): Limits how long `vkAcquireNextImageKHR` can block. On timeout, the image semaphore is recreated (matching the existing `VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DATE_KHR` path) and the frame is skipped. Setting this to `0` restores the previous unlimited wait.\r\n- `display/window/wayland/frame_callback_timeout_ms` (default: `100`): Limits how long `try_suspend()` waits for frame callbacks so input continues to be processed during compositor stalls. Setting this to `0` restores the previous `1000` ms behavior.\r\n- `rendering/rendering_device/vulkan/prefer_mailbox_present_mode` (default: `false`): Uses `MAILBOX` instead of `FIFO` when available. This avoids the stall entirely, at the cost of slightly higher GPU usage.\r\n\r\nI originally enabled the mailbox workaround by default on NVIDIA, but left it opt-in because it previously caused issues on NVIDIA + X11 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114986#issuecomment-4512438646). Present mode behavior varies significantly between vendors and drivers. With the timeout changes alone, the editor recovers instead of hanging permanently. Enabling mailbox also eliminates the temporary stutter.\r\n\r\nTested on an RTX 3060 (610.43.03) running KDE Wayland. Before this change I could reliably reproduce the freeze using the embedded game view. Afterward, the editor remains responsive and recovers correctly.\r\n\r\nAll three settings are documented in `ProjectSettings.xml`.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-24T09:07:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T16:51:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-30T16:37:31Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b844bd07d32e2a282d8bc36332832273668546f7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"bearlikelion:mark/wayland","ref":"mark/wayland","repo":{"id":1052945106,"node_id":"R_kgDOPsKq0g","name":"godot","full_name":"bearlikelion/godot","owner":{"login":"bearlikelion","id":3298808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTg4MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3298808